  "paragraphs": [
    "Universe Glitch gives your footage and text the look of compressed, glitched video. This tool emulates poor internet connections, bad video encoding, corrupt data streams, and low-bandwidth broadcasts.",
    "Apply preconfigured Glitch distortions to your text and images with these convenient shortcuts. Find these presets via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create a Glitch look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
  ],
